WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.836
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:01.106 --> 00:02.524
[♪ opening theme song plays]

3
00:43.065 --> 00:48.070
THE PERFECT LIE

4
00:53.158 --> 00:54.743
THIS DRAMA IS A WORK OF FICTION

5
00:54.826 --> 00:58.080
SCENES INVOLVING CHILD ACTORS AND ANIMALS WERE FILMED SAFELY

6
01:01.958 --> 01:05.504
-[♪ unsettling music plays] -How about a glass of wine?

7
01:09.675 --> 01:11.176
Sure, wine sounds nice.

8
01:12.135 --> 01:13.136
All right.

9
01:22.020 --> 01:23.021
[Jisun exclaims]

10
01:25.565 --> 01:27.150
You okay?

11
01:27.234 --> 01:30.153
[Jisun] Nothing in this house seems to be cooperating today.

12
01:31.279 --> 01:32.280
Here, let me.

13
01:33.907 --> 01:37.619
It's not much, but I'd like to be helpful somehow.

14
01:38.745 --> 01:41.039
Then I'll leave it to you.

15
01:41.123 --> 01:42.249
Sure.

16
01:55.178 --> 01:57.180
[♪ pensive music plays]

17
02:04.020 --> 02:05.647
I should put on some music.

18
02:05.730 --> 02:07.482
Is there anything you want to listen to?

19
02:09.192 --> 02:10.902
Whatever you like.

20
02:27.544 --> 02:29.379
I haven't listened to this in forever.

21
02:30.505 --> 02:32.466
I used to listen to it all the time.

22
02:33.049 --> 02:35.385
It might be a little scratchy.

23
02:37.137 --> 02:38.138
Found it.

24
03:13.715 --> 03:15.717
[♪ jazzy music plays]

25
03:25.352 --> 03:26.937
This feels like you, Jisun.

26
03:28.563 --> 03:29.689
What makes you say that?

27
03:33.443 --> 03:38.073
There's something lonely about you, but it's kind of alluring.

28
04:06.434 --> 04:07.602
Thank you.

29
04:22.617 --> 04:24.578
[♪ ominous music plays]

30
04:36.214 --> 04:37.215
[breathing heavily]

31
04:44.848 --> 04:50.270
EPISODE 4 BOOMERANG

32
04:50.353 --> 04:53.857
[automated voice] The phone is turned off. Please leave a message after…

33
04:53.940 --> 04:55.442
Her phone's still off.

34
04:56.109 --> 04:58.570
The principal is in a meeting right now, so…

35
04:59.738 --> 05:01.531
We're looking into it too.

36
05:02.073 --> 05:03.491
All right, bye.

37
05:03.575 --> 05:05.535
Where the heck is she?

38
05:05.619 --> 05:07.704
I have no idea. Her phone's off.

39
05:07.787 --> 05:09.122
[principal] Why is her phone off?

40
05:09.205 --> 05:11.207
I'm not sure because it's turned off.

41
05:14.002 --> 05:18.048
I mean, doesn't this just make it look like she's the one they're talking about?

42
05:18.131 --> 05:19.966
If it isn't her, she needs to say so.

43
05:20.050 --> 05:22.719
Otherwise, how are we supposed to figure out what to do?

44
05:23.678 --> 05:25.180
How can she deny it?

45
05:25.263 --> 05:27.682
We're the only private school in Sangcheon--

46
05:27.766 --> 05:29.225
You think I don't know that?

47
05:29.309 --> 05:32.646
We need to hear it from her directly before we can take further action!

48
05:33.939 --> 05:34.940
Sir…

49
05:35.857 --> 05:38.151
Complaints are pouring in on the school website

50
05:38.234 --> 05:40.570
asking if Kang Jisun is the gold-digger teacher.

51
05:40.654 --> 05:42.781
IS KANG JISUN THE GOLD-DIGGER TEACHER?

52
05:42.864 --> 05:43.949
[♪ tense music plays]

53
05:44.616 --> 05:46.284
[principal huffing]

54
05:46.368 --> 05:47.994
But who's the man?

55
05:48.078 --> 05:49.079
[phone rings]

56
05:50.330 --> 05:51.831
Oh, hello, sir.

57
05:53.166 --> 05:54.960
He's in a meeting right now.

58
05:55.043 --> 05:56.753
I understand.

59
05:58.213 --> 05:59.339
[call disconnects]

60
05:59.422 --> 06:02.842
The head of the board wants you to call.

61
06:02.926 --> 06:07.389
[exhales sharply] What the hell does she take this school for?

62
06:08.848 --> 06:12.268
Mr. Park, keep trying to reach Ms. Kang.

63
06:12.811 --> 06:15.021
And you arrange for someone to cover her classes.

64
06:15.105 --> 06:16.147
Sir.

65
06:17.315 --> 06:20.485
Shouldn't we deal with Ms. Kang's disciplinary action first?

66
06:20.568 --> 06:23.321
The parents are going to start showing up here soon.

67
06:23.405 --> 06:25.490
Yes, I think that would be best too.

68
06:25.573 --> 06:29.244
We need to take disciplinary action first if we want things to settle down.

69
06:29.828 --> 06:33.164
When does Ms. Kang's contract end?

70
06:37.210 --> 06:38.336
[Sanghyeon] Hey, Min Hyunsoo.

71
06:39.295 --> 06:41.506
Ms. Kang reported being sexually assaulted, right?

72
06:42.090 --> 06:45.427
And your dad was at the police station a few days ago over a sex offense.

73
06:46.261 --> 06:48.930
You think maybe Ms. Kang and your dad did it?

74
06:50.015 --> 06:51.141
Shut up.

75
06:51.891 --> 06:53.059
I never said they did.

76
06:53.143 --> 06:54.728
I'm just asking.

77
06:54.811 --> 06:56.479
I said shut up.

78
06:56.563 --> 06:58.106
Fine, man.

79
06:58.898 --> 07:02.193
But if they really did it, what about your mom?

80
07:02.861 --> 07:04.320
Does she know?

81
07:07.115 --> 07:09.159
I'm just asking, man!

82
07:09.242 --> 07:10.243
Hey!

83
07:11.161 --> 07:12.162
Damn it.

84
07:12.245 --> 07:14.497
Oh, my gosh! What are you two doing?

85
07:15.582 --> 07:16.958
What do you think you're doing?

86
07:17.041 --> 07:20.253
Geez. I was just asking about Ms. Kang and his dad.

87
07:20.336 --> 07:21.671
-Damn it. -[students exclaim]

88
07:21.755 --> 07:23.298
-[Sanghyeon] Get lost! -My goodness! Hey!

89
07:24.007 --> 07:27.051
[Hanui] Hello, everyone. Welcome to Baek Hanui's Question Mark.

90
07:27.635 --> 07:29.971
It's an unusually warm spring day.

91
07:30.054 --> 07:33.767
But did you know that weather like this can actually put our hearts at risk?

92
07:33.850 --> 07:37.061
Today, we're joined by cardiovascular surgeon, Dr. Min Junho,

93
07:37.145 --> 07:40.732
who's here to tell us how to keep our hearts healthy.

94
07:40.815 --> 07:42.400
BAEK HANUI'S QUESTION MARK

95
07:42.484 --> 07:43.651
Welcome.

96
07:44.277 --> 07:45.278
Dr. Min,

97
07:45.361 --> 07:49.282
spring usually puts everyone in high spirits,

98
07:49.365 --> 07:51.743
but it can actually be dangerous for our hearts?

99
07:51.826 --> 07:53.286
Yes, that's right.

100
07:53.369 --> 07:55.538
Spring is a season of major temperature swings.

101
07:57.207 --> 07:58.541
[knocks on door]

102
07:58.625 --> 07:59.667
[Junho] Yes.

103
08:01.377 --> 08:02.754
Dr. Min.

104
08:02.837 --> 08:03.838
[Junho exclaims]

105
08:04.339 --> 08:07.133
You did a great job. I learned a lot thanks to you.

106
08:07.217 --> 08:08.760
You were great too.

107
08:09.803 --> 08:12.847
If you're free for dinner, would you like to join me?

108
08:14.849 --> 08:15.892
What do you think?

109
08:18.186 --> 08:19.187
Oh…

110
08:20.188 --> 08:21.689
I wasn't expecting that.

111
08:23.107 --> 08:24.108
[Hanui exclaims]

112
08:24.192 --> 08:28.822
If I take "unexpected" in a good way, it means you were pleasantly surprised.

113
08:28.905 --> 08:30.323
If I take it in a bad way,

114
08:30.406 --> 08:32.742
it means you're getting ready to turn me down, right?

115
08:35.161 --> 08:38.832
There's something I haven't quite sorted out emotionally,

116
08:39.707 --> 08:43.169
so I don't really have the headspace to spend time with someone right now.

117
08:43.253 --> 08:45.004
I heard you were single.

118
08:45.088 --> 08:47.340
-Do you have a girlfriend? -[sighs]

119
08:48.133 --> 08:49.175
[Junho chuckles softly]

120
08:49.259 --> 08:52.554
There was someone I wanted a serious relationship with,

121
08:52.637 --> 08:54.055
but it didn't work out.

122
08:55.932 --> 08:57.684
How could anyone turn you down?

123
08:59.018 --> 09:00.478
I just wish she'd recognize

124
09:01.521 --> 09:03.982
how I truly feel, even at this point.

125
09:09.821 --> 09:11.698
-I'm sorry. -[chuckles]

126
09:13.825 --> 09:14.826
That's too bad.

127
09:14.909 --> 09:17.620
Next time we have you on, make sure you've got it sorted out.

128
09:18.580 --> 09:19.747
[chuckles]

129
09:24.752 --> 09:26.963
[♪ soft music plays]

130
09:27.046 --> 09:28.673
-[door closes] -[sighs]

131
09:30.300 --> 09:32.177
[phone buzzing]

132
09:37.765 --> 09:40.310
[automated voice] The phone is turned off. Please leave a message…

133
09:40.393 --> 09:41.477
-[call disconnects] -[Jieun sighs]

134
09:41.561 --> 09:42.562
Jieun.

135
09:46.816 --> 09:48.318
Did you see the article?

136
09:48.401 --> 09:49.402
[Junghyeon] Yeah.

137
09:54.032 --> 09:55.033
Are you okay?

138
09:57.827 --> 09:59.287
Jisun's not answering her phone?

139
10:00.455 --> 10:02.665
No, but she should be at school right now.

140
10:04.209 --> 10:06.002
[sighs] I'm worried about her.

141
10:09.505 --> 10:11.257
She got through it last time too.

142
10:14.427 --> 10:15.553
She'll be okay.

143
10:17.597 --> 10:23.603
I'm so scared she might do something to herself.

144
10:24.437 --> 10:25.438
Jieun.

145
10:26.981 --> 10:28.858
Jisun isn't that weak.

146
10:28.942 --> 10:30.151
She'll be fine.

147
10:36.616 --> 10:38.618
[♪ brooding music plays]

148
11:15.863 --> 11:17.156
[Junghyeon] She's not answering.

149
11:18.449 --> 11:19.450
[Jieun sighs]

150
11:21.577 --> 11:22.912
-Jisun! -[Junghyeon] Jisun!

151
11:24.122 --> 11:25.456
What happened? Are you okay?

152
11:25.540 --> 11:28.793
[Jieun gasps] Hey, you're… You're going to catch a cold.

153
11:28.876 --> 11:30.795
-Let's get you inside. -[Jisun] I'm…

154
11:32.463 --> 11:33.673
I'm hungry.

155
11:34.632 --> 11:36.301
[Jieun] Okay, let's get you something to eat.

156
11:36.384 --> 11:37.802
-[Junghyeon] Man… -[Jieun] Let's go inside.

157
11:37.885 --> 11:39.887
How did you get so soaked?

158
11:55.778 --> 11:57.071
[Jisun] When you're surfing…

159
11:59.365 --> 12:01.576
the place where you start is called the lineup.

160
12:03.745 --> 12:06.622
But on the way out there, wave after wave keeps coming at you.

161
12:13.046 --> 12:15.590
-Whether you go over them or around them… -[♪ pensive music plays]

162
12:16.883 --> 12:19.344
…you have to make it through to reach the lineup.

163
12:22.889 --> 12:24.223
Getting to the starting point…

164
12:26.434 --> 12:28.895
might be the hardest part of surfing.

165
12:34.650 --> 12:36.486
Earlier, I really wanted to die.

166
12:48.748 --> 12:51.250
All kinds of thoughts came to me together with the waves.

167
12:54.587 --> 12:55.755
"Should I run away?"

168
12:56.756 --> 12:58.257
"Should I just die?"

169
13:02.720 --> 13:04.680
"If I make it through those waves,

170
13:05.890 --> 13:08.393
will I be able to get back to the starting point?"

171
13:20.780 --> 13:23.533
Even though I knew the waves would probably sweep me away.

172
13:29.330 --> 13:30.415
[Jisun sighs]

173
13:32.375 --> 13:33.501
[Jieun sighs]

174
13:36.754 --> 13:38.089
What about the school?

175
13:39.006 --> 13:40.383
Haven't they said anything?

176
13:42.635 --> 13:44.262
I didn't do anything wrong, you know.

177
13:44.762 --> 13:46.139
It's my job.

178
13:48.808 --> 13:51.185
The foundation isn't going to let this slide.

179
13:51.269 --> 13:54.897
If you're really dead-set on doing this, you need to know what you're getting into.

180
13:55.940 --> 13:58.609
What you've been through so far will seem like nothing.

181
13:58.693 --> 14:01.404
The truth will get lost, and only the controversy will remain.

182
14:01.487 --> 14:04.031
But the truth always comes out eventually.

183
14:04.657 --> 14:06.325
What if it doesn't?

184
14:10.413 --> 14:13.499
It'll be better than living like I'm already dead.

185
14:24.510 --> 14:25.845
[Junho] Are you going to keep this up?

186
14:28.848 --> 14:29.849
[Junho sighs]

187
14:31.642 --> 14:34.937
I don't know whether I should scold you or try to comfort you.

188
14:36.063 --> 14:38.441
If there's anything you want to tell me, go ahead.

189
14:39.358 --> 14:41.903
And if there's anything you want to ask, just ask.

190
14:45.072 --> 14:47.408
[Hyunsoo] There's someone at school I can actually talk to now.

191
14:48.618 --> 14:50.828
Who, Soyeon?

192
14:53.122 --> 14:54.457
Ms. Kang Jisun.

193
15:01.172 --> 15:02.423
Was it Ms. Kang?

194
15:06.552 --> 15:07.595
What do you mean?

195
15:09.388 --> 15:11.265
Did you do it with my teacher?

196
15:13.809 --> 15:16.479
I said bad things about that woman without knowing anything.

197
15:16.562 --> 15:18.606
-But if it was Ms. Kang-- -It was Ms. Kang.

198
15:22.026 --> 15:24.779
-Why didn't you tell me? -I had no idea she'd be like that.

199
15:26.322 --> 15:28.449
I kept quiet because of you, Hyunsoo.

200
15:28.532 --> 15:31.827
She's your teacher, and I was worried it might hurt you in some way.

201
15:31.911 --> 15:35.498
Even if people pointed fingers at me, I couldn't let you suffer because of it.

202
15:39.585 --> 15:40.628
So…

203
15:42.463 --> 15:43.839
just keep going to school.

204
15:45.883 --> 15:46.968
[exhales shakily]

205
15:48.511 --> 15:49.637
No.

206
15:49.720 --> 15:50.930
I don't want to.

207
15:51.013 --> 15:52.223
I'm not going to school.

208
15:56.227 --> 15:57.228
[door slams]

209
15:58.479 --> 15:59.480
[sighs]

210
16:04.652 --> 16:05.820
[Hwayoung] I saw the article.

211
16:09.657 --> 16:10.783
[Jisun] Do you believe me?

212
16:13.369 --> 16:14.412
Yes.

213
16:15.871 --> 16:16.956
Liar.

214
16:20.334 --> 16:21.669
Some of it, at least.

215
16:24.547 --> 16:26.340
I'm not a gold digger.

216
16:31.095 --> 16:33.597
And I'm not some mentally unstable pathological liar.

217
16:37.226 --> 16:38.227
I…

218
16:41.480 --> 16:43.024
I didn't lie.

219
16:48.029 --> 16:49.030
[Hwayoung exhales deeply]

220
16:55.328 --> 16:56.912
Remember your polygraph?

221
17:00.041 --> 17:01.208
And…

222
17:01.292 --> 17:02.710
you're the one who reported that

223
17:02.793 --> 17:04.670
there were narcotics at Min's house, right?

224
17:06.922 --> 17:08.674
I don't know anything about that.

225
17:09.425 --> 17:10.718
That's a lie.

226
17:12.345 --> 17:13.971
I don't know how you knew,

227
17:14.055 --> 17:17.433
but you even specified that it was under the bed.

228
17:18.017 --> 17:21.228
Two vehicles and five police officers were deployed for the search.

229
17:21.312 --> 17:23.981
Do you know what you could face for making a false report--

230
17:24.065 --> 17:26.692
Well, I'm glad you were diligent when it came to drugs.

231
17:29.570 --> 17:33.783
You were painfully slow when investigating my case.

232
17:43.959 --> 17:44.960
[Hwayoung] Want one?

233
17:46.962 --> 17:47.963
No.

234
17:55.596 --> 17:58.432
I don't think the investigation was entirely conclusive either.

235
18:01.727 --> 18:03.604
The reason I wanted to meet with you…

236
18:06.399 --> 18:08.526
was to warn you…

237
18:11.404 --> 18:12.905
about Min Junho.

238
18:16.283 --> 18:18.244
[♪ unsettling music plays]

239
18:22.331 --> 18:23.416
[Junho] Wait, Detective.

240
18:26.460 --> 18:27.586
If you're free,

241
18:28.921 --> 18:30.589
would you like to get a drink with me?

242
18:39.849 --> 18:41.684
You asked us to include a question

243
18:42.476 --> 18:45.688
about Min Junho's late wife in the polygraph test.

244
18:48.566 --> 18:51.610
We actually did include it.

245
18:53.487 --> 18:55.781
[examiner] Did you love your wife?

246
18:57.241 --> 18:59.243
DID YOU LOVE YOUR WIFE?

247
18:59.326 --> 19:00.327
Yes.

248
19:02.663 --> 19:03.664
[button clicks]

249
19:03.748 --> 19:06.167
[examiner] What's your happiest memory with your wife?

250
19:08.252 --> 19:12.840
I'd have to say when our child was born.

251
19:16.051 --> 19:18.679
[examiner] Did you ever resent your wife

252
19:19.722 --> 19:21.766
for taking her own life?

253
19:23.809 --> 19:24.810
No.

254
19:29.398 --> 19:31.025
[examiner] Did you feel guilty?

255
19:31.108 --> 19:34.904
DID YOU FEEL GUILTY ABOUT YOUR WIFE'S DEATH?

256
19:40.659 --> 19:45.623
I loved my wife so much that I respected the final choice she made.

257
19:52.087 --> 19:54.965
She looked free from all the pain she'd been living with.

258
19:57.927 --> 19:59.345
She looked at peace.

259
20:01.222 --> 20:05.184
[Hwayoung] When his wife died of respiratory failure from a drug overdose…

260
20:07.812 --> 20:09.563
Min Junho was at home.

261
20:13.526 --> 20:17.530
If he had anything to do with his wife's death…

262
20:19.657 --> 20:21.158
he's a very dangerous man.

263
20:22.785 --> 20:24.662
Don't try to confront him.

264
20:25.704 --> 20:27.873
Just stay as far away from him as you can.

265
20:30.376 --> 20:32.002
Why are you telling me all this?

266
20:36.298 --> 20:38.175
It's not as a police officer…

267
20:41.220 --> 20:42.805
Just woman to woman.

268
20:45.432 --> 20:48.477
Officially, you're not supposed to be telling me this, are you?

269
20:48.978 --> 20:50.980
[♪ soft music plays]

270
20:51.522 --> 20:53.566
Maybe it's the hormones.

271
20:55.025 --> 20:56.402
I'm pregnant.

272
21:02.700 --> 21:04.660
It makes me think about the kind of world…

273
21:06.495 --> 21:07.872
my child will grow up in.

274
21:12.042 --> 21:15.546
If anything happens, or if you ever need anything, call me.

275
21:56.587 --> 21:57.963
[Soyeon] Aren't you going to school?

276
22:00.591 --> 22:01.884
How did you find me here?

277
22:02.927 --> 22:04.470
I looked for you.

278
22:05.137 --> 22:07.014
You can never hide from me.

279
22:10.643 --> 22:12.019
Why aren't you going to school?

280
22:12.728 --> 22:14.021
[sighs]

281
22:14.104 --> 22:15.189
Why aren't you?

282
22:16.982 --> 22:19.026
I put in for an experiential learning day.

283
22:20.069 --> 22:21.070
Why?

284
22:22.112 --> 22:23.447
[sighs deeply]

285
22:23.530 --> 22:26.241
I barely passed the monthly evaluation, so I need to practice.

286
22:26.992 --> 22:29.828
My singing's fine, but apparently my dancing needs work.

287
22:30.579 --> 22:32.039
[groans]

288
22:32.122 --> 22:33.332
So annoying.

289
22:36.710 --> 22:39.421
Want to team up with me for the science project presentation?

290
22:40.839 --> 22:41.840
You and me?

291
22:43.258 --> 22:45.552
You're the best at science in our class.

292
22:47.554 --> 22:48.764
I don't want to.

293
22:50.099 --> 22:51.100
Why not?

294
22:51.976 --> 22:53.936
Do it with your boyfriend.

295
22:54.019 --> 22:55.062
[scoffs]

296
22:55.145 --> 22:57.231
Who? Sanghyeon?

297
22:57.856 --> 22:59.900
[laughs] That's crazy.

298
22:59.984 --> 23:02.111
He just let me use his account the most, okay?

299
23:03.237 --> 23:05.072
That's why I'm just being nice to him.

300
23:06.281 --> 23:09.451
Besides, I already have a boyfriend.

301
23:12.496 --> 23:13.497
You.

302
23:17.626 --> 23:18.627
What?

303
23:19.253 --> 23:20.254
You don't want to be?

304
23:22.923 --> 23:25.551
You're kind of a loser at everything except studying.

305
23:26.385 --> 23:28.637
And I'm only a loser when it comes to studying.

306
23:28.721 --> 23:30.472
Losers should stick together.

307
23:31.598 --> 23:32.850
Deal?

308
23:35.561 --> 23:38.939
And I don't care at all about what happened with your dad.

309
23:40.607 --> 23:42.943
I don't even care what my own dad is up to.

310
23:46.613 --> 23:47.781
[indistinct chattering]

311
23:55.539 --> 23:56.999
[students] Hello.

312
23:57.082 --> 23:58.208
Hi.

313
23:58.292 --> 24:00.627
-[student 1] Hey, it's the gold digger. -[student 2] Don't make eye contact.

314
24:00.711 --> 24:02.129
-[♪ unsettling music plays] -[student 1] She really has no shame.

315
24:02.212 --> 24:03.297
[student 2] But is that story true?

316
24:03.380 --> 24:04.381
-[student 1] I wonder too. -Hello.

317
24:04.465 --> 24:06.050
-[student 1] Isn't that insane? -[student 2] I know.

318
24:06.133 --> 24:07.801
[students] Hello.

319
24:08.469 --> 24:11.013
[student 1] You think she became a teacher to extort money from people?

320
24:11.096 --> 24:13.682
-[students snicker] -[student 2] Wow, so embarrassing.

321
24:15.100 --> 24:16.643
[student 3] Hey, it's the gold-digger teacher.

322
24:16.727 --> 24:19.938
[student 4] She gives me the creeps. Why's she here? Wasn't she fired?

323
24:21.148 --> 24:24.109
[student 3] What's this going to do to our school's reputation?

324
24:24.693 --> 24:28.322
Our priority is keeping the students from getting worked up,

325
24:28.405 --> 24:30.365
especially with midterms coming up…

326
24:30.449 --> 24:31.700
[Jisun] I'm sorry I'm late.

327
24:33.410 --> 24:34.536
[teacher] Ms. Kang Jisun?

328
24:35.621 --> 24:36.830
Spare me a minute.

329
24:41.877 --> 24:43.003
[teacher scoffs]

330
24:44.671 --> 24:47.758
Do you think you can show up to school whenever you feel like it?

331
24:48.550 --> 24:49.635
I'm sorry.

332
24:50.177 --> 24:52.387
You know how much the parents complain, don't you?

333
24:52.471 --> 24:55.641
When it comes to their kids, they scrutinize every little thing,

334
24:55.724 --> 24:57.101
and then gossip about it.

335
24:58.102 --> 25:00.270
Haven't you ever wondered

336
25:00.354 --> 25:03.357
whether you really belong at Sangcheon's top private school?

337
25:07.736 --> 25:08.779
Pardon me?

338
25:10.447 --> 25:14.076
The school board has agreed that they simply can't overlook a teacher

339
25:14.159 --> 25:16.537
who has disgraced the school's name.

340
25:19.289 --> 25:22.126
I've disgraced the school's name?

341
25:24.711 --> 25:25.712
[sighs]

342
25:26.672 --> 25:29.007
-I find that hard to accept-- -Everyone's up in arms,

343
25:29.091 --> 25:30.759
saying you made baseless accusations

344
25:30.843 --> 25:34.429
and damaged the reputation of a highly successful man!

345
25:35.806 --> 25:37.224
And it's not just Dr. Min.

346
25:37.307 --> 25:40.644
Hyunsoo is at one of the most important stages of his life.

347
25:44.314 --> 25:45.315
[teacher sighs]

348
25:46.692 --> 25:47.985
[teacher groans]

349
25:48.068 --> 25:49.319
What about me?

350
25:53.198 --> 25:54.408
What about my life?

351
25:59.538 --> 26:01.957
Get it sorted out before it becomes a bigger issue.

352
26:02.040 --> 26:03.625
You know what I mean, right?

353
26:05.127 --> 26:06.128
[scoffs]

354
26:39.411 --> 26:41.079
[Jisun] I'm the victim.

355
26:45.334 --> 26:47.336
That's why I filed a complaint, but…

356
26:49.213 --> 26:51.965
the accused was released due to insufficient evidence.

357
26:58.805 --> 27:00.307
I've requested a reinvestigation,

358
27:00.390 --> 27:02.768
and I believe his side leaked the story to the press.

359
27:08.565 --> 27:10.067
The article is clearly false,

360
27:10.943 --> 27:12.861
and I'm going to demand a correction.

361
27:20.452 --> 27:23.455
I'm going to see this through until the truth comes out.

362
27:25.207 --> 27:28.710
That's the only way I can face my students without shame.

363
27:31.004 --> 27:32.005
[principal] Ms. Kang, you…

364
27:34.299 --> 27:38.095
You've violated your duty to maintain the dignity expected of a teacher.

365
27:41.556 --> 27:42.808
How is that…

366
27:42.891 --> 27:44.476
It's a matter of personal privacy.

367
27:45.435 --> 27:47.229
So it's not my place to get involved.

368
27:48.355 --> 27:53.777
And whether the article is true isn't really the issue.

369
27:54.861 --> 27:56.989
If the truth doesn't matter, then what does?

370
27:58.824 --> 28:00.450
It was written with malicious intent.

371
28:02.452 --> 28:04.246
It's just something that's going around,

372
28:04.329 --> 28:06.540
so I don't know how much of it to believe, but…

373
28:07.708 --> 28:08.875
they say the man…

374
28:11.837 --> 28:13.714
was Min Hyunsoo's father.

375
28:20.762 --> 28:21.763
That…

376
28:25.017 --> 28:27.728
did not violate any professional ethics.

377
28:30.981 --> 28:34.526
If you don't see anything wrong

378
28:34.609 --> 28:37.237
with a teacher getting personally involved…

379
28:40.157 --> 28:42.200
with a student's parent,

380
28:42.951 --> 28:44.786
that's even more of a problem.

381
28:51.752 --> 28:54.004
Was it Dr. Min Junho?

382
29:00.385 --> 29:01.386
Yes.

383
29:05.348 --> 29:06.349
[principal exhales sharply]

384
29:09.811 --> 29:11.938
I think it'd be best to take a leave of absence.

385
29:12.731 --> 29:16.443
Of course, we could convene a disciplinary committee…

386
29:16.526 --> 29:17.778
[♪ soft music plays]

387
29:17.861 --> 29:20.906
…but putting you through something like that

388
29:20.989 --> 29:23.492
wouldn't do you any good either.

389
29:25.452 --> 29:27.454
Your teacher evaluations have been good.

390
29:28.371 --> 29:34.377
And I appreciate how hard you've worked for the students.

391
29:38.673 --> 29:40.842
Rather than the school putting you on leave,

392
29:42.677 --> 29:44.721
I think it'd be better if you requested one.

393
29:46.932 --> 29:47.933
[principal sighs]

394
29:52.437 --> 29:53.897
Ms. Kang Jisun.

395
29:56.817 --> 29:58.902
A teacher who stands in front of students

396
29:59.694 --> 30:01.530
can't fall apart so easily,

397
30:02.531 --> 30:04.032
no matter the reason.

398
30:19.297 --> 30:20.298
[phone chimes]

399
30:25.804 --> 30:27.389
[person] You're finished now.

400
30:30.767 --> 30:31.977
[thud]

401
30:36.106 --> 30:38.108
[♪ suspenseful music plays]

402
30:46.908 --> 30:47.951
YOU'RE FINISHED NOW!

403
30:48.034 --> 30:49.161
[Jisun] Who are you?

404
30:50.412 --> 30:51.413
[phone chimes]

405
30:53.123 --> 30:54.124
[phone chimes]

406
30:56.293 --> 30:58.503
[person] Someone who knows you very well.

407
30:59.087 --> 31:00.088
[gasps]

408
31:13.018 --> 31:14.019
[objects clattering]

409
31:26.907 --> 31:33.663
TO MS. KANG JISUN FROM KIM RIAN

410
31:52.182 --> 31:53.183
[muffled chatter]

411
32:12.744 --> 32:13.745
[student 1 gasps]

412
32:14.704 --> 32:15.705
[student 2] Stop it.

413
32:22.837 --> 32:24.839
[♪ tense music plays]

414
32:27.050 --> 32:29.052
[indistinct murmuring]

415
33:06.673 --> 33:08.133
Why did you do that to my dad?

416
33:12.220 --> 33:13.221
What?

417
33:14.222 --> 33:15.765
Was it really for money?

418
33:19.769 --> 33:21.062
Did your dad say that?

419
33:21.146 --> 33:23.231
Even after everything, he said you were a good person.

420
33:25.984 --> 33:27.652
I want to be a good person.

421
33:27.736 --> 33:29.404
I've always tried to live that way.

422
33:30.864 --> 33:31.948
But your dad really--

423
33:32.032 --> 33:33.033
My dad, what?

424
33:39.164 --> 33:40.373
[Jisun sniffles]

425
33:40.457 --> 33:43.543
I want to tell you I'm sorry, but I don't know if I should.

426
33:43.626 --> 33:45.003
You should apologize to my dad.

427
33:45.086 --> 33:47.714
No. I don't owe your dad an apology.

428
33:54.804 --> 33:58.058
I can't explain how things got to this,

429
33:58.141 --> 33:59.976
but I didn't lie.

430
34:09.319 --> 34:10.612
Hyunsoo.

431
34:11.613 --> 34:12.614
Are you okay?

432
34:14.657 --> 34:16.076
Don't pretend you care.

433
34:29.381 --> 34:30.465
[knocking]

434
34:30.548 --> 34:31.800
[person] Yes?

435
34:31.883 --> 34:33.635
PRINCIPAL JEONG SANGYEONG

436
34:33.718 --> 34:34.719
-[person 2] Hello. -Ah.

437
34:38.056 --> 34:39.057
[Sangyeong] Hello.

438
34:39.891 --> 34:43.311
Oh, yes. You came all the way out here.

439
34:43.395 --> 34:44.687
SANGCHEON MEDIA OH DAESIK

440
34:46.940 --> 34:50.193
I'd like to dig a little deeper into what happened at the time.

441
34:50.276 --> 34:53.196
I was thinking there might be enough for an in-depth piece.

442
34:53.279 --> 34:57.033
Well, I've read the article and even done a phone interview,

443
34:57.617 --> 35:01.246
but I can't help wondering if it's right to keep digging into something like this.

444
35:01.329 --> 35:05.166
It's been keeping me up at night and bothering me.

445
35:05.250 --> 35:07.419
Fighting injustice is never easy.

446
35:08.128 --> 35:11.464
But the longer people stay silent, the more victims there will be.

447
35:11.548 --> 35:13.049
Exactly.

448
35:13.591 --> 35:16.720
The world has changed so much from the way it used to be.

449
35:16.803 --> 35:20.306
I heard you went through quite an ordeal back then.

450
35:20.390 --> 35:22.475
It was a difficult time.

451
35:23.393 --> 35:25.729
In my 36 years as an educator,

452
35:25.812 --> 35:27.897
nothing like that had ever happened before.

453
35:28.565 --> 35:32.235
Anyway, I decided it was all due to my own shortcomings,

454
35:32.944 --> 35:34.654
so I forgave her and put it behind me.

455
35:34.738 --> 35:35.739
Hmm…

456
35:37.323 --> 35:43.705
So Ms. Kang Jisun falsely accused you of demanding sexual favors from her

457
35:43.788 --> 35:46.583
and even sexually harassing her,

458
35:46.666 --> 35:48.001
and you forgave her?

459
35:48.084 --> 35:52.547
She really went too far, accusing me of something like that.

460
35:52.630 --> 35:55.467
I was so dumbfounded and felt so wronged

461
35:55.550 --> 35:57.802
that I had security cameras installed afterward.

462
35:57.886 --> 36:00.722
Look. I had two of them installed.

463
36:03.475 --> 36:05.977
So none of that ever happened?

464
36:06.728 --> 36:08.480
Of course not.

465
36:08.980 --> 36:11.357
I thought of her like a daughter.

466
36:11.441 --> 36:13.151
No, don't get the wrong idea.

467
36:13.234 --> 36:15.320
She's actually an old friend's daughter.

468
36:16.446 --> 36:17.447
Really?

469
36:18.031 --> 36:20.116
Her father died young,

470
36:20.200 --> 36:22.118
so I knew she'd had a hard time growing up.

471
36:23.453 --> 36:27.832
I hired her as a contract teacher for my late friend's sake.

472
36:28.416 --> 36:30.585
Then, about a year later,

473
36:31.252 --> 36:34.714
they told us to replace all contract teachers with permanent ones.

474
36:35.381 --> 36:38.426
Anyway, she heard about it and came to see me.

475
36:40.804 --> 36:42.388
[Sangyeong groans, clears throat]

476
36:42.472 --> 36:43.890
[♪ tense music plays]

477
36:43.973 --> 36:44.974
Ms. Kang.

478
36:48.645 --> 36:51.481
I think we'll have to let you go at the end of this month.

479
36:53.107 --> 36:56.152
You're very popular with the students,

480
36:56.820 --> 36:59.906
and they did well in the last academic competition too.

481
37:02.283 --> 37:04.077
But I'm sorry it had to come to this.

482
37:04.953 --> 37:06.287
Exactly, sir.

483
37:07.580 --> 37:09.833
I got all my students to place in the competition.

484
37:09.916 --> 37:11.960
How can you just let me go all of a sudden?

485
37:12.043 --> 37:16.673
The foundation wants us rated as an outstanding educational institution,

486
37:17.173 --> 37:19.175
so all our teachers have to be full-time.

487
37:19.259 --> 37:21.010
That's the policy they handed down.

488
37:24.264 --> 37:27.183
But you could put in a good word for me, sir.

489
37:27.267 --> 37:28.434
Can't you do that for me?

490
37:30.645 --> 37:34.399
You know I think of you like a daughter, right?

491
37:34.983 --> 37:37.652
And you know I think of you like a father, right?

492
37:39.112 --> 37:42.240
You should take the certification exam and get a job at a public school.

493
37:43.616 --> 37:45.368
Are you really going to do this to me?

494
37:45.994 --> 37:48.162
I'm saying this for your own good.

495
37:48.246 --> 37:51.708
If you want what's best for me, you should pull some strings for me.

496
37:51.791 --> 37:54.294
There's nothing I can do about the foundation's decision.

497
37:54.377 --> 37:56.546
What could I possibly do?

498
38:06.764 --> 38:09.684
Then the next day, I got a call from the police.

499
38:09.767 --> 38:10.768
She told them

500
38:11.853 --> 38:13.855
that I tried to do something to her.

501
38:15.106 --> 38:16.858
Even though you didn't do anything?

502
38:16.941 --> 38:19.152
How could I ever think of her that way?

503
38:19.235 --> 38:21.654
I've known her since she was a kid.

504
38:21.738 --> 38:24.616
[groans] I don't even want to think about what happened after that.

505
38:24.699 --> 38:26.075
It was a living hell.

506
38:26.159 --> 38:29.078
Everyone got the wrong idea, and nasty rumors went around.

507
38:29.913 --> 38:32.957
I haven't told anyone before, but I thought about taking my own life.

508
38:34.167 --> 38:36.961
Then why did you pay her a settlement?

509
38:37.837 --> 38:38.838
A settlement?

510
38:39.881 --> 38:41.049
I never paid her anything.

511
38:41.132 --> 38:44.636
The police said she dropped the charges after receiving a settlement.

512
38:44.719 --> 38:46.346
Oh, no, that's not what happened.

513
38:46.429 --> 38:48.056
She has an older sister, Jieun.

514
38:48.139 --> 38:50.892
Her sister made a scene, asking how she could be doing this

515
38:50.975 --> 38:52.685
and told her to drop the charges.

516
38:53.394 --> 38:55.897
I was just about to be cleared, by the way.

517
38:56.564 --> 39:00.068
Then, Jieun came and got on her knees, begging for forgiveness.

518
39:01.110 --> 39:04.364
I felt bad for her, so I gave five million won as severance.

519
39:05.615 --> 39:07.784
As severance pay, not a settlement?

520
39:07.867 --> 39:08.868
Yes.

521
39:08.952 --> 39:12.080
She was still my friend's daughter, so I couldn't help but feel for her.

522
39:12.163 --> 39:14.123
[chuckles] Though later,

523
39:14.207 --> 39:16.626
I thought maybe I shouldn't have done that either.

524
39:16.709 --> 39:17.710
Why's that?

525
39:19.003 --> 39:21.965
Well, I'd rather not dig up things from her past if I don't have to.

526
39:23.049 --> 39:25.551
Her? Who do you mean? Ms. Kang Jisun?

527
39:29.806 --> 39:31.641
Well, since we're on the subject…

528
39:31.724 --> 39:32.725
Take a look at this.

529
39:33.601 --> 39:35.645
A parent took this photo and shared it with me.

530
39:35.728 --> 39:39.649
They work at this hotel, and apparently she frequents this place.

531
39:39.732 --> 39:41.985
You know, the place that was on the news

532
39:42.068 --> 39:45.196
for young people drinking, dancing, and partying it up.

533
39:45.279 --> 39:47.448
-What do you call it? -A nightclub.

534
39:47.532 --> 39:48.574
-A club. -Yes.

535
39:48.658 --> 39:49.909
Apparently she's a regular.

536
39:49.993 --> 39:51.911
They ran into her several times.

537
39:51.995 --> 39:55.665
They said they took the photo to complain to the school

538
39:55.748 --> 39:57.959
about hiring someone like her as a teacher,

539
39:58.042 --> 39:59.419
regardless of her private life.

540
40:02.880 --> 40:04.090
This photo…

541
40:04.173 --> 40:05.466
Could you send it to me?

542
40:10.388 --> 40:11.764
[crosswalk signal chirping]

543
40:15.101 --> 40:17.103
[♪ unsettling music plays]

544
40:33.619 --> 40:36.831
[Hanui] You really are the man who protects hearts.

545
40:36.914 --> 40:39.042
Now, for my final question.

546
40:39.125 --> 40:42.754
When does the heart pound the most?

547
40:42.837 --> 40:44.547
Is it when we're in danger?

548
40:45.298 --> 40:47.341
-[♪ tense music plays] -You see, the heart… [hums]

549
40:48.634 --> 40:49.886
It actually pounds more

550
40:50.887 --> 40:53.389
when you're lying than when you're in danger.

551
40:56.017 --> 40:59.103
So for your heart's sake, try not to lie.

552
41:03.524 --> 41:04.692
[phone chiming]

553
41:13.868 --> 41:15.870
[commenter] Can a party girl really be a teacher?

554
41:28.007 --> 41:30.259
ACCUSED MAN'S LIFE IN RUINS, ACCUSER HITS THE CLUBS

555
41:30.343 --> 41:31.344
REPORTER OH DAESIK

556
41:35.598 --> 41:36.599
[phone chimes]

557
41:38.893 --> 41:40.311
YOUR LIFE IS OVER NOW. SERVES YOU RIGHT.

558
41:40.394 --> 41:41.562
YOUR FATHER WOULD BE SO PROUD.

559
41:43.731 --> 41:45.525
[Sangyeong] Your life is over now.

560
41:46.067 --> 41:47.693
Serves you right.

561
41:47.777 --> 41:50.029
Your father would be so proud.

562
42:06.879 --> 42:08.881
[♪ tense music playing]

563
42:19.725 --> 42:21.144
[Sangyeong] Well, well.

564
42:21.227 --> 42:22.562
To what do I owe the pleasure?

565
42:22.645 --> 42:24.272
[Jisun] Why are you doing this to me?

566
42:24.355 --> 42:26.274
This has nothing to do with you.

567
42:26.357 --> 42:29.026
He ended up your victim just like I did.

568
42:29.986 --> 42:32.029
It's time you fixed that nasty habit of yours,

569
42:32.113 --> 42:35.616
leading men on, then stabbing them in the back.

570
42:35.700 --> 42:37.451
I dropped the charges.

571
42:37.535 --> 42:39.287
Everyone told me not to, but I did.

572
42:39.871 --> 42:41.956
I gave you a chance,

573
42:42.039 --> 42:43.666
and that's how you repay me?

574
42:43.749 --> 42:46.544
I got that job on my own!

575
42:46.627 --> 42:48.171
[Sangyeong laughs]

576
42:48.921 --> 42:51.174
You wouldn't have gotten that job without me.

577
42:51.257 --> 42:53.759
Did you think everything would come that easy?

578
42:54.677 --> 42:57.013
You give a little, you get a little.

579
42:57.096 --> 42:58.556
That's only fair!

580
43:00.600 --> 43:01.767
You people…

581
43:03.311 --> 43:05.563
You haven't changed at all.

582
43:07.148 --> 43:08.232
And you never will.

583
43:08.316 --> 43:09.317
[call disconnects]

584
43:10.526 --> 43:12.153
You little…

585
43:18.367 --> 43:19.368
What the hell?

586
43:19.952 --> 43:21.746
You gave them that photo, didn't you?

587
43:22.705 --> 43:23.831
Why, you little…

588
43:23.915 --> 43:26.292
Show some respect to your father's friend!

589
43:26.375 --> 43:28.002
If you don't want another fight,

590
43:28.753 --> 43:30.588
call that reporter.

591
43:31.672 --> 43:34.634
Tell them what you did and how you covered it up.

592
43:35.509 --> 43:36.677
For crying out loud.

593
43:38.429 --> 43:41.307
If you're here to ask for a favor, you should ask nicely.

594
43:44.018 --> 43:46.938
Or give me a little something in return.

595
43:50.107 --> 43:52.109
[♪ ominous music plays]

596
43:57.406 --> 43:59.992
Do you want to keep teaching?

597
44:01.118 --> 44:02.453
Oh, yes.

598
44:15.633 --> 44:18.386
Then ask nicely.

599
44:22.765 --> 44:26.310
Or give me a little something in return.

600
44:40.491 --> 44:44.704
Look at that. Just walking off without even saying goodbye.

601
44:44.787 --> 44:46.706
That rude little…

602
44:48.749 --> 44:50.668
Hey, what are you doing?

603
44:50.751 --> 44:52.003
[Sangyeong screams]

604
44:52.086 --> 44:53.087
[bucket thuds]

605
44:53.170 --> 44:55.589
[Jisun, voice breaking] Stay out of my life from now on…

606
44:56.299 --> 44:58.301
[♪ dramatic music plays]

607
44:59.510 --> 45:01.262
…or you'll have to face my father

608
45:02.972 --> 45:05.975
and beg him for forgiveness on your knees.

609
45:14.650 --> 45:15.651
[line ringing]

610
45:18.654 --> 45:22.408
DETECTIVE LEE HWAYOUNG

611
45:22.491 --> 45:24.368
-[Hwayoung] Yes, Ms. Kang? -Jeong Sangyeong.

612
45:25.619 --> 45:29.248
He's the reason the polygraph said I was lying.

613
45:29.332 --> 45:31.375
I was afraid they'd think I did it habitually.

614
45:38.758 --> 45:42.178
[examiner] Have you ever reported a sex crime before?

615
45:47.183 --> 45:49.268
No, I have not.

616
45:52.355 --> 45:53.356
[polygraph beeping]

617
46:02.448 --> 46:04.241
[sighs] Damn it.

618
46:07.953 --> 46:10.790
BAEK HANUI'S QUESTION MARK

619
46:10.873 --> 46:12.833
VIEWER MESSAGE BOARD

620
46:14.960 --> 46:16.504
WRITE A POST

621
46:19.840 --> 46:21.175
[Jisun] Min Junho,

622
46:21.258 --> 46:24.011
no matter how convincing a mask you wear,

623
46:24.095 --> 46:25.888
you're still a sex offender.

624
46:30.351 --> 46:31.352
[keyboard clacking]

625
46:38.025 --> 46:39.026
[mumbling]

626
46:48.536 --> 46:50.496
ORIGINAL POST EXPOSING STAR DOCTOR

627
46:50.579 --> 46:54.583
I am Kang Jisun, a teacher at Sangcheon Haeon Elementary School.

628
46:54.667 --> 46:57.211
I was recently accused of being a gold digger.

629
46:57.294 --> 46:58.671
[nurse] Hey, have you seen this post?

630
46:59.547 --> 47:04.427
[Jisun] I'm writing this publicly because I want the truth to come out.

631
47:04.510 --> 47:06.762
-[doctor 1] Did you see this? -[doctor 2] Yeah, what's this about?

632
47:06.846 --> 47:10.099
[Jisun] Min Junho is a sex offender

633
47:10.891 --> 47:14.645
hiding behind the mask of a brilliant cardiovascular surgeon and a good father.

634
47:15.688 --> 47:17.648
-[sighs] -From now on,

635
47:17.731 --> 47:19.984
the whole world will come to know who he really is.

636
47:26.449 --> 47:28.826
There's something I want to say to him.

637
47:28.909 --> 47:30.161
Hyunsoo.

638
47:31.370 --> 47:32.455
What are you doing?

639
47:34.248 --> 47:37.168
[Jisun] Min Junho, now it's your turn to suffer.

640
47:48.304 --> 47:49.930
EXPOSÉ POSTED ON VIEWER MESSAGE BOARD

641
47:50.014 --> 47:51.974
UNIVERSITY HOSPITAL CARDIOVASCULAR SURGEON

642
47:58.355 --> 47:59.356
[sighs]

643
47:59.440 --> 48:00.441
[thud]

644
48:00.941 --> 48:02.735
How can you show your face at school?

645
48:03.569 --> 48:05.154
Son of a criminal.

646
48:05.237 --> 48:07.281
-It's disgusting. -Shut up.

647
48:07.364 --> 48:10.659
Your dad did something to our teacher. The whole school knows now.

648
48:10.743 --> 48:12.578
Damn it, what do you even know?

649
48:12.661 --> 48:14.830
[Sanghyeon groans] Are you freaking crazy?

650
48:14.914 --> 48:16.373
Damn you!

651
48:16.457 --> 48:17.625
Get lost!

652
48:18.876 --> 48:20.419
-[Sanghyeon] Damn it. -[teacher] Hey!

653
48:20.920 --> 48:23.464
-What do you think you're doing? -[Hyunsoo groans softly]

654
48:23.547 --> 48:24.924
[teacher] Hey! Hey!

655
48:27.593 --> 48:30.262
Here, let me see you.

656
48:30.971 --> 48:32.431
[teacher exhales sharply, groans]

657
48:34.058 --> 48:35.059
[phone rings]

658
48:38.979 --> 48:40.022
Yes?

659
48:40.105 --> 48:43.442
[nurse] Dr. Min, did you postpone Yunji's surgery?

660
48:43.526 --> 48:45.861
No. Her surgery is tomorrow.

661
48:47.404 --> 48:48.614
-[Yunji's mom talks indistinctly] -[knocks]

662
48:48.697 --> 48:49.782
[Yunji's mom] Yes.

663
48:52.952 --> 48:56.622
Ma'am, you didn't give Yunji any chocolate today, did you?

664
48:57.331 --> 48:58.666
Dr. Min.

665
49:04.255 --> 49:07.007
[scoffs] Is something wrong?

666
49:09.218 --> 49:10.219
Did you…

667
49:11.220 --> 49:12.805
postpone the surgery because…

668
49:12.888 --> 49:13.889
I didn't postpone it.

669
49:13.973 --> 49:16.350
I asked for a different doctor.

670
49:17.851 --> 49:20.521
I can't entrust my child to a sex offender.

671
49:24.525 --> 49:27.027
I clearly asked for a different doctor,

672
49:27.111 --> 49:29.530
so if he keeps coming in whenever he pleases,

673
49:29.613 --> 49:31.448
we'll have to change hospitals.

674
49:31.991 --> 49:34.994
Ma'am, there's been a misunderstanding.

675
49:37.288 --> 49:38.831
Yunji's life is at stake.

676
49:38.914 --> 49:42.209
-We need to go ahead with the surgery-- -I decide what's best for my child.

677
49:43.586 --> 49:45.504
To think she was in your care this whole time.

678
49:45.588 --> 49:47.006
-Ma'am… -[nurse] Dr. Min.

679
49:47.089 --> 49:49.049
I didn't get a chance to tell you.

680
49:49.842 --> 49:52.469
The well-being of the patient and guardian comes first,

681
49:52.553 --> 49:54.597
so please step outside for now.

682
49:54.680 --> 49:56.098
[phone ringing]

683
50:01.604 --> 50:02.605
[ringing stops]

684
50:11.071 --> 50:12.072
Hello?

685
50:12.156 --> 50:14.074
[teacher] Am I speaking with Hyunsoo's father?

686
50:19.955 --> 50:21.624
Oh, Mr. Min.

687
50:24.335 --> 50:25.336
What happened?

688
50:25.419 --> 50:28.380
The CT results are normal. It's just a minor head injury.

689
50:28.464 --> 50:30.799
We put in six stitches, and we're almost done.

690
50:32.176 --> 50:34.261
[teacher] Mr. Min, I sincerely apologize.

691
50:34.928 --> 50:40.351
I'll make sure the students who hurt him receive appropriate disciplinary action.

692
50:42.019 --> 50:43.354
Who did this to you?

693
50:44.396 --> 50:45.689
Can't we just let it go?

694
50:45.773 --> 50:47.858
We can't just let violence slide.

695
50:48.776 --> 50:50.778
Tell me. Are you going to tell me or not?

696
50:50.861 --> 50:52.488
Have you always done the right thing?

697
51:00.079 --> 51:01.413
[line ringing]

698
51:03.749 --> 51:05.793
[♪ tense music plays]

699
51:05.876 --> 51:07.544
What exactly do you want from me?

700
51:09.254 --> 51:10.339
The truth.

701
51:11.090 --> 51:13.342
Please, just stop with those ridiculous lies!

702
51:13.425 --> 51:16.387
I can't stop because they're not lies.

703
51:16.470 --> 51:20.099
Do you have any idea what my son and I are going through because of you?

704
51:20.182 --> 51:22.768
That's not because of me. It's because of you.

705
51:23.560 --> 51:26.814
If you hadn't done that to me, none of this would've happened.

706
51:27.648 --> 51:28.649
[exhales sharply]

707
51:29.733 --> 51:34.071
By now, you would've been planning to make a nice sum off me.

708
51:35.698 --> 51:37.449
Is this because that didn't work out?

709
51:37.533 --> 51:39.660
You drugged my wine.

710
51:41.120 --> 51:43.122
You thought I'd never find out, didn't you?

711
51:43.747 --> 51:46.291
If you've done something wrong, you have to pay the price!

712
51:47.209 --> 51:48.210
[call disconnects]

713
51:56.135 --> 51:57.302
[Junho exhales sharply]

714
51:58.762 --> 52:01.181
Sue her for false accusation and defamation right away.

715
52:01.265 --> 52:03.767
You need to be firm for Hyunsoo to hold his head up high.

716
52:04.893 --> 52:05.894
[sighs]

717
52:06.979 --> 52:09.523
-[♪ gentle music plays] -I'll never understand some people.

718
52:10.107 --> 52:12.609
Hey, I know that better than anyone, okay?

719
52:12.693 --> 52:15.571
You can never forgive a woman like that. What's the law there for?

720
52:20.075 --> 52:21.535
[Junho exhales deeply]

721
52:29.543 --> 52:30.544
[door lock beeps]

722
52:32.963 --> 52:34.089
[door lock beeps]

723
52:35.466 --> 52:37.760
[door lock beeping]

724
52:37.843 --> 52:39.303
-[door unlocks] -What the…

725
52:41.472 --> 52:42.473
[door opens]

726
52:43.390 --> 52:45.392
-[Jisun screams] -[Jieun] Oh, my gosh!

727
52:47.644 --> 52:49.188
Jieun… [sighs]

728
52:49.271 --> 52:50.564
Goodness.

729
52:52.733 --> 52:55.235
[Jieun] Your phone was off, so…

730
52:55.319 --> 52:57.738
Gosh, Jieun…

731
53:06.538 --> 53:10.125
It's because I gave up instead of fighting to the end back then.

732
53:13.128 --> 53:14.713
So now…

733
53:16.673 --> 53:20.177
it came back like a boomerang and turned me into a liar.

734
53:22.721 --> 53:24.014
[sighs]

735
53:24.097 --> 53:25.432
Because of that…

736
53:26.725 --> 53:29.561
I've lost everything I've achieved up until now.

737
53:32.606 --> 53:33.607
[Jieun sighs]

738
53:34.483 --> 53:36.985
Jisun, do you want one too?

739
53:37.903 --> 53:40.739
I shouldn't have accepted the money from the principal back then.

740
53:40.823 --> 53:41.824
[can opens]

741
53:42.407 --> 53:43.659
It's okay.

742
53:45.494 --> 53:48.580
You were fooled by that sly old bastard too.

743
53:49.706 --> 53:52.626
You said he lied and said it was money he had borrowed from Dad.

744
53:54.378 --> 53:55.963
We were too naive.

745
53:56.463 --> 53:58.006
[Hyeongsu] Neither of you did anything wrong.

746
53:58.090 --> 54:00.342
Those bastards are the ones to blame.

747
54:00.926 --> 54:04.346
Let's focus on getting you a job first.

748
54:05.222 --> 54:07.891
[Hyeongsu] Yeah, you can do anything, Jisun.

749
54:13.021 --> 54:14.523
I will…

750
54:17.276 --> 54:19.027
uncover the truth at all costs

751
54:20.487 --> 54:22.739
and put everything back the way it was.

752
54:28.287 --> 54:29.288
[Hyeongsu sighs]

753
54:30.080 --> 54:31.081
[Hyeongsu] Jisun.

754
54:32.249 --> 54:33.333
I get what you're saying.

755
54:34.585 --> 54:36.670
I totally agree with you.

756
54:36.753 --> 54:38.046
But…

757
54:38.130 --> 54:40.090
how are you going to uncover the truth?

758
54:50.684 --> 54:51.768
I don't know.

759
54:56.189 --> 54:57.941
I don't know yet either.

760
55:10.579 --> 55:11.913
[Jieun] Thanks to the article,

761
55:11.997 --> 55:15.000
the post you wrote is getting tons of views.

762
55:17.753 --> 55:18.837
I know.

763
55:20.839 --> 55:23.133
I also know what everyone's saying.

764
55:26.762 --> 55:30.057
"Serial gold digger after settlement money."

765
55:30.140 --> 55:31.642
"He's too good for her."

766
55:31.725 --> 55:33.226
"Pathological liar."

767
55:36.855 --> 55:40.067
You shouldn't have posted it on social media under your real name.

768
55:41.068 --> 55:42.653
If there are people supporting you,

769
55:42.736 --> 55:45.697
there are bound to be people criticizing and attacking you too.

770
55:46.990 --> 55:50.118
I can't even have him punished, and you're telling me to stay quiet?

771
55:51.119 --> 55:54.748
They've already branded me promiscuous. What good would keeping quiet do?

772
55:54.831 --> 55:57.376
[sighs] I'm just worried about you.

773
55:59.002 --> 56:01.505
You can't keep starting over.

774
56:05.717 --> 56:08.136
I'm going to rethink everything from the beginning.

775
56:08.220 --> 56:09.471
From the very beginning.

776
56:15.894 --> 56:17.896
[♪ unsettling music plays]

777
56:31.868 --> 56:34.204
[Jieun] Jisun, did you go somewhere?

778
56:34.955 --> 56:35.956
[Jisun] Jieun.

779
56:36.665 --> 56:39.376
What happened that day might have been planned from the start.

780
56:41.044 --> 56:43.964
Maybe I wasn't Min Junho's first victim.

781
56:45.382 --> 56:46.717
[Jieun] What are you talking about?

782
56:47.551 --> 56:51.304
[Jisun] This time, I'm not stopping halfway.

783
56:52.305 --> 56:54.891
I'm going to find out exactly who he really is.

784
56:56.101 --> 56:57.561
[Jieun] Where are you now?

785
57:03.525 --> 57:05.277
Defamation and false accusation?

786
57:09.156 --> 57:11.992
My lawyer friend offered to file the complaint for me,

787
57:13.034 --> 57:15.579
but I'm still not sure.

788
57:17.330 --> 57:19.791
And there were a few things I wanted to ask you,

789
57:19.875 --> 57:20.959
so I came in person.

790
57:22.252 --> 57:23.253
Go ahead.

791
57:29.676 --> 57:33.430
I was reported for a drug offense and investigated--

792
57:33.513 --> 57:34.931
I know.

793
57:39.936 --> 57:44.149
The police came into my house, didn't search anywhere else,

794
57:44.232 --> 57:46.902
and went straight for the vials under my bed.

795
57:46.985 --> 57:48.487
I know that too.

796
57:56.703 --> 57:58.705
What else do you know?

797
58:01.166 --> 58:02.417
That's all.

798
58:08.882 --> 58:11.885
It looks like someone broke into my house.

799
58:12.719 --> 58:14.554
I checked the security cameras too.

800
58:15.096 --> 58:17.849
You can't really see her face, but it's definitely a woman.

801
58:17.933 --> 58:19.601
Are you going to report it?

802
58:23.688 --> 58:24.898
If I do, can you find her?

803
58:25.398 --> 58:27.067
File a report first, then we can talk.

804
58:29.027 --> 58:31.655
And I don't handle defamation or false accusation cases.

805
58:45.794 --> 58:46.795
[Junho sighs]

806
58:50.715 --> 58:52.217
[inhales deeply]

807
58:52.300 --> 58:55.929
Thank you for all your help until now.

808
58:57.138 --> 58:58.223
Goodbye.

809
58:59.724 --> 59:00.725
[keyboard clacking]

810
59:09.234 --> 59:10.235
[sighs]

811
59:21.913 --> 59:23.331
I'll see you again.

812
59:30.422 --> 59:31.423
[door closes]

813
59:46.354 --> 59:48.315
[automated voice] In a moment, you'll enter

814
59:48.398 --> 59:50.483
a 60-kilometer-per-hour speed enforcement zone.

815
59:59.075 --> 01:00:01.077
[♪ tense music plays]

816
01:00:03.163 --> 01:00:04.623
-[gasps] -[brakes screech]

817
01:00:04.706 --> 01:00:06.124
[cars honking]

818
01:00:08.960 --> 01:00:10.462
-[cars honking] -[gasps]

819
01:00:35.820 --> 01:00:37.155
[door lock beeping]

820
01:00:37.906 --> 01:00:38.907
[door unlocks]

821
01:00:44.204 --> 01:00:45.997
[♪ tense music plays]

822
01:01:01.012 --> 01:01:03.014
SATURDAY, SUNDAY

823
01:01:03.098 --> 01:01:04.265
[Hwayoung] Hey, it's me.

824
01:01:04.849 --> 01:01:06.601
I need you to run a plate for me.

825
01:01:06.685 --> 01:01:08.770
It's 182P 1905.

826
01:01:09.771 --> 01:01:12.357
Yeah, I just need the registered owner's name.

827
01:01:13.108 --> 01:01:14.526
Get it to me as soon as you can.

828
01:01:15.777 --> 01:01:16.778
Thanks.

829
01:01:20.031 --> 01:01:21.032
[call disconnects]

830
01:01:28.123 --> 01:01:29.124
[bottle opens]

831
01:01:54.691 --> 01:01:55.692
[door lock beeping]

832
01:02:00.280 --> 01:02:01.281
[door unlocks]

833
01:02:04.325 --> 01:02:06.828
[♪ tense music plays]

834
01:02:13.835 --> 01:02:14.836
[door locks]

835
01:02:24.721 --> 01:02:25.722
[camera shutter clicks]

836
01:02:29.934 --> 01:02:30.935
[camera shutter clicks]

837
01:02:35.565 --> 01:02:36.566
[camera shutter clicks]

838
01:02:40.695 --> 01:02:41.696
[camera shutter clicks]

839
01:02:52.582 --> 01:02:53.583
[camera shutter clicks]

840
01:02:56.419 --> 01:02:57.420
[phone buzzing]

841
01:03:02.675 --> 01:03:07.055
MY HUSBAND

842
01:03:07.639 --> 01:03:08.932
[buzzing continues]

843
01:03:42.507 --> 01:03:44.509
[♪ haunting music plays]

844
01:03:46.761 --> 01:03:50.682
THE PERFECT LIE

845
01:04:15.915 --> 01:04:16.958
[door closes]

846
01:04:17.041 --> 01:04:20.253
[Jisun] You can't believe Min Junho would do something like that, can you?

847
01:04:21.629 --> 01:04:24.424
I hope you can go to the police and tell them the truth,

848
01:04:25.008 --> 01:04:28.761
and let people know what kind of person Min Junho really is.

849
01:04:28.845 --> 01:04:32.307
[Junho] You're only making things worse for yourself by doing this here.

850
01:04:32.390 --> 01:04:34.184
[Hwayoung] Did you find out who the car is registered to?

851
01:04:34.267 --> 01:04:36.102
[Junho] I'll give you a chance to start over.

852
01:04:36.186 --> 01:04:37.770
[patron] How about we share a bottle of wine?

853
01:04:37.854 --> 01:04:39.022
-Wait! Hey. -[Jisun screams]

854
01:04:39.105 --> 01:04:42.233
With sincere remorse and an apology.

855
01:04:43.902 --> 01:04:45.361
[Jisun] You win.

856
01:04:45.445 --> 01:04:47.280
[♪ unsettling music plays]

857
01:05:01.252 --> 01:05:02.837
THE PERFECT LIE

858
01:05:02.921 --> 01:05:04.923
Translated by Liya Hyunjoo Choi
